WEBVTT

00:00:05.240 --> 00:00:08.820
Now I know that it really
was because he thoroughly hates me.

00:00:09.950 --> 00:00:11.490
Ito-senpai...

00:00:22.820 --> 00:00:25.030
What's the matter, Ayado?

00:00:29.070 --> 00:00:31.360
Don't you "What's the matter" me!

00:00:31.700 --> 00:00:33.400
Why did you ignore me?!

00:00:33.740 --> 00:00:36.860
Why would you tell me I don't have to talk to you?!

00:00:37.650 --> 00:00:39.150
Why...?

00:00:40.450 --> 00:00:44.820
Why are you the only thing I ever think about anymore?

00:00:53.900 --> 00:00:56.780
It still makes my heart beat faster.

00:01:13.990 --> 00:01:17.570
Konna tokoro de naitetatte

00:01:17.700 --> 00:01:23.570
Daremo kizuki ya shinai wakatterunda

00:01:23.780 --> 00:01:27.280
Nanmo nakatta ka no you ni

00:01:27.360 --> 00:01:32.990
Kako o keshisatte sekai dake susunde yuku

00:01:33.110 --> 00:01:37.820
Kimi o utsusu to kimeta film nanoni

00:01:37.950 --> 00:01:42.360
Tamatte yuku soko nashi no sora

00:01:42.360 --> 00:01:44.400
Wasuretatte kiechainai

00:01:44.400 --> 00:01:47.110
Ano itami wa hora, nan dattakke?

00:01:47.110 --> 00:01:52.780
Kawaru keshiki mayotte shimatta nara

00:01:52.900 --> 00:01:56.900
Ano uta o omoidashite miyou ka

00:01:56.900 --> 00:02:02.450
Sou ne, kanashii koto mo futari nara

00:02:02.610 --> 00:02:06.240
Takaramono ni natte yuku hazu sa

00:02:06.360 --> 00:02:15.360
Nijinde mo kienakatta

00:02:15.490 --> 00:02:20.780
Ano hi no kimi o misetai

00:02:29.900 --> 00:02:32.280
Hello, I am Sumie Ayado.

00:02:30.070 --> 00:02:35.530
Episode 17
Regarding Miss Ayado's
New Mental Anguish.

00:02:32.610 --> 00:02:35.400
In this episode, I will be doing the honors
of providing some narration.

00:02:38.450 --> 00:02:39.740
I'm home!

00:02:40.110 --> 00:02:41.610
Welcome back, Sumie.

00:02:41.820 --> 00:02:43.650
Here, I brought you a present.

00:02:43.650 --> 00:02:46.570
My, my! Look at all those garden nasturtiums!

00:02:46.570 --> 00:02:48.900
There were a bunch of them
growing in the school flowerbeds.

00:02:48.900 --> 00:02:50.610
I'll go get a vase!

00:02:50.610 --> 00:02:51.150
Okay!

00:02:51.150 --> 00:02:53.950
We're having your favorite tonight! Ratatouille!

00:02:53.950 --> 00:02:55.990
Yay! I'll help cook!

00:02:54.650 --> 00:02:56.320
Right after
I change!!

00:02:56.780 --> 00:02:59.200
My home life had always been really peaceful.

00:02:59.530 --> 00:03:04.450
I was raised by two very by-the-book
but very kind civil servant parents.

00:03:04.650 --> 00:03:08.450
And I had a surprising amount of freedom
as I grew up into my middle school years.

00:03:08.450 --> 00:03:10.490
I even had a fair number of friends.

00:03:10.740 --> 00:03:12.070
Hey, have you heard?

00:03:12.070 --> 00:03:14.900
Mina and Ishii from Class 2 have started dating!

00:03:15.070 --> 00:03:16.700
What?! Dating?!

00:03:16.700 --> 00:03:19.070
But we're only in middle school!

00:03:19.360 --> 00:03:22.610
I
don't
understand...

00:03:19.780 --> 00:03:21.900
Th-they're in love...

00:03:22.860 --> 00:03:26.950
But then, in my second year of middle school,
he came into my life.

00:03:27.280 --> 00:03:29.240
I had found my own first love.

00:03:29.570 --> 00:03:31.820
What?! You're in love, Sumi?

00:03:31.820 --> 00:03:33.070
Who is it?!

00:03:33.360 --> 00:03:35.610
I didn't
do it
for you...
I did it
because I will
be the one
to defeat you!!

00:03:36.240 --> 00:03:38.610
His name is Domuistone...

00:03:39.360 --> 00:03:41.780
He was a side character in a shonen manga.

00:03:42.700 --> 00:03:46.780
That's when I started immersing myself
in the two-dimensional world.

00:03:46.780 --> 00:03:48.490
And the next thing I knew...

00:03:48.490 --> 00:03:50.740
She's reading manga again.

00:03:50.740 --> 00:03:53.030
I heard her first love was a manga character.

00:03:53.280 --> 00:03:56.780
I had crossed a line, and there was no turning back.

00:03:57.400 --> 00:04:00.990
Fortunately, because I had been raised
by such big-hearted parents...

00:04:00.990 --> 00:04:03.200
Sumie, we're going hiking in the mountains!

00:04:03.200 --> 00:04:06.150
A sound mind lives in a sound body, after all!

00:04:06.570 --> 00:04:10.320
At first, it was easy to think
that their opinions didn't matter, but...

00:04:10.900 --> 00:04:11.990
Nemisis Trigger

00:04:13.530 --> 00:04:15.240
I've been trying to get your attention.

00:04:15.240 --> 00:04:16.530
Why are you ignoring me?

00:04:16.530 --> 00:04:18.450
I-I'm sorry.

00:04:18.570 --> 00:04:21.280
I was just so absorbed in my book.
I didn't mean to ignore you.

00:04:21.450 --> 00:04:24.400
Stop reading manga all the time, otaku.

00:04:26.030 --> 00:04:29.530
It was the first time anyone ever
directed real malice towards me.

00:04:30.650 --> 00:04:34.110
And the thing is, it's almost Domuistone's birthday.

00:04:34.320 --> 00:04:36.860
And the Nemesis Trigger cafe
is going to have a party for him.

00:04:36.860 --> 00:04:40.740
Sumi, you know I don't really understand any of that stuff.

00:04:40.740 --> 00:04:41.740
Oh, sorry!

00:04:41.900 --> 00:04:45.780
Anyway, this magazine has an article on this band,
and just the other day...

00:04:46.150 --> 00:04:50.490
Even the girls who I thought were my close friends
started to seem a little farther away.

00:04:49.650 --> 00:04:58.110
SHELL

00:04:50.990 --> 00:04:54.200
And I wondered if things would be different
if I'd said I was in love with someone else,

00:04:54.200 --> 00:04:56.110
even if I had to lie about it.

00:04:58.820 --> 00:05:04.570
The way I am now, I think I might make
people uncomfortable without even realizing it.

00:05:09.070 --> 00:05:10.110
Ayado.

00:05:11.700 --> 00:05:13.320
Um, here.

00:05:15.030 --> 00:05:18.280
Oh, there you are! Ayado! Come to the courtyard!

00:05:22.320 --> 00:05:26.110
You can talk to us, or say hi, whenever you want to.

00:05:26.530 --> 00:05:28.780
You can always join us, Ayado.

00:05:30.240 --> 00:05:33.070
I fell in love with an actual person.

00:05:33.450 --> 00:05:36.900
It was the first time I ever had a crush on a boy.

00:05:38.450 --> 00:05:39.900
And now...

00:05:41.150 --> 00:05:42.360
Um, I...

00:05:42.360 --> 00:05:43.280
I'm sorry!

00:05:51.070 --> 00:05:52.320
I won't let you go again.

00:05:54.860 --> 00:05:58.950
I'm going to make sure you have no doubt in your mind.

00:06:00.400 --> 00:06:03.280
I know I can make you like me.

00:06:04.950 --> 00:06:07.820
Senpai, I was so scared.

00:06:08.200 --> 00:06:13.200
I learned that love hurts.
It's painful and embarrassing. And after all that, I...

00:06:14.240 --> 00:06:17.610
I was afraid to ever set foot in that territory again.

00:06:18.360 --> 00:06:22.610
But I was even more afraid
at the thought of you leaving me.

00:06:24.110 --> 00:06:27.570
Senpai, I've hurt you so much, and I'm sorry!

00:06:27.950 --> 00:06:32.030
But I'm about to ask you something very self-serving.

00:06:34.400 --> 00:06:36.820
Can I still be a part of your life?

00:06:43.400 --> 00:06:44.820
Of course you can.

00:06:51.990 --> 00:06:52.950
I'm sorry.

00:06:54.030 --> 00:06:55.030
I'm so sorry.

00:06:55.030 --> 00:06:57.240
H-hold on a minute!

00:07:00.570 --> 00:07:03.360
I'm sorry it took me so long to give it back.

00:07:06.070 --> 00:07:08.740
No, you're crying, too.

00:07:09.280 --> 00:07:11.570
You use it, Ayado.

00:07:21.070 --> 00:07:23.360
And... that's what happened.

00:07:23.490 --> 00:07:27.490
What?! So you're saying... you and Ito are a couple now?

00:07:27.490 --> 00:07:29.150
Isn't this happy news?

00:07:29.150 --> 00:07:35.400
No! After all the trouble I caused both of you,
now I end up dating your best friend!

00:07:35.400 --> 00:07:37.530
It just doesn't seem right in my mind!

00:07:38.150 --> 00:07:40.360
First, I must beg your forgiveness!

00:07:40.360 --> 00:07:42.700
Just a min- What are you doing, Ayado?

00:07:43.030 --> 00:07:44.900
Wh-why are you groveling?

00:07:45.070 --> 00:07:49.360
Come on. Tsutsun doesn't really
think about that stuff. Everything's fine.

00:07:49.610 --> 00:07:50.320
Now stand up.

00:07:50.740 --> 00:07:53.650
But wow... you're dating.

00:07:55.610 --> 00:07:57.070
That's great.

00:07:57.280 --> 00:07:59.110
I'm so happy for you, Ito.

00:07:59.490 --> 00:08:01.650
Spring has finally come for you, too.

00:08:02.450 --> 00:08:07.450
Uh, I think you might complicate things for Ayado
if you get too happy about that.

00:08:07.450 --> 00:08:09.240
Huh? Oh, right.

00:08:10.780 --> 00:08:12.490
Congratulations to Ito & Ayado

00:08:11.570 --> 00:08:12.530
What?!

00:08:12.530 --> 00:08:14.450
So it all worked out with you two?!

00:08:15.360 --> 00:08:16.360
Good for you.

00:08:16.610 --> 00:08:18.150
Not that I know what's going on.

00:08:18.570 --> 00:08:21.820
And thank you for always being there
to listen to me, Ishino-senpai.

00:08:21.820 --> 00:08:23.530
I really appreciate it.

00:08:23.530 --> 00:08:27.360
I intend to keep striving hard every day,
so if you would kindly continue to be there-

00:08:27.360 --> 00:08:29.030
Quit being so serious!

00:08:28.780 --> 00:08:32.030
You getting married
or something?

00:08:29.030 --> 00:08:30.990
As long as you're both having fun, that's what matters!

00:08:30.990 --> 00:08:31.950
So knock yourselves out!

00:08:32.900 --> 00:08:34.570
I'm happy for you, Tiny.

00:08:34.990 --> 00:08:36.740
Thanks, Ishino.

00:08:37.030 --> 00:08:38.860
But what happened?

00:08:38.860 --> 00:08:40.450
Everyone's all in happy land.

00:08:40.820 --> 00:08:42.150
Let's go on a date, Takanashi.

00:08:42.150 --> 00:08:42.820
No.

00:08:42.820 --> 00:08:45.450
Why don't you ever even take any time to think about it?!

00:08:45.570 --> 00:08:48.280
Because, you know. Making a date with you...?

00:08:48.240 --> 00:08:49.450
Not
very exciting

00:08:48.280 --> 00:08:51.780
But you called me cute
at the school festival and you know it!

00:08:51.780 --> 00:08:52.820
The feeling has died.

00:08:52.990 --> 00:08:54.530
What do you mean, it died?!

00:08:54.530 --> 00:08:57.030
Say that after your heart has actually
skipped a beat over me for once!

00:08:57.030 --> 00:08:59.530
Alright then. Make my heart skip a beat. I dare you.

00:09:00.450 --> 00:09:01.950
You're infuriating!

00:09:02.400 --> 00:09:04.240
How dare you talk to me like that?!

00:09:03.530 --> 00:09:04.240
Tsutsui?

00:09:06.150 --> 00:09:07.650
Thanks for everything.

00:09:08.110 --> 00:09:12.240
I'm going to work hard, so my relationship
can be like yours and Igarashi's.

00:09:12.450 --> 00:09:13.240
Ito...

00:09:13.900 --> 00:09:15.280
you did good.

00:09:17.360 --> 00:09:18.150
Yeah.

00:09:19.450 --> 00:09:21.490
It all worked out for Ito.

00:09:21.490 --> 00:09:23.780
And I don't have to go to Oshamambe.

00:09:24.070 --> 00:09:26.400
My peaceful life has returned.

00:09:26.610 --> 00:09:28.150
I'm a little scared.

00:09:28.700 --> 00:09:31.320
But I gotta say, peace is nice!

00:09:34.490 --> 00:09:35.990
It's been so long...

00:09:36.320 --> 00:09:38.030
since I've been to your house.

00:09:38.740 --> 00:09:41.700
Your mom and dad are getting along again.

00:09:38.740 --> 00:09:40.240
How much do you love me?

00:09:40.240 --> 00:09:45.570
I love you this much!

00:09:41.700 --> 00:09:45.570
Yeah. They've been getting along so well,
it's actually creepy.

00:09:46.070 --> 00:09:49.740
I'm really glad you didn't have to go to Oshamambe.

00:09:50.650 --> 00:09:54.030
It-it's been a while... since we've been this close.

00:09:54.360 --> 00:09:55.150
Yeah.

00:10:07.450 --> 00:10:08.110
Wait a-

00:10:08.610 --> 00:10:11.650
3.1415926535897932...

00:10:12.110 --> 00:10:14.030
Iroha! Would you like to stay for dinner?

00:10:14.820 --> 00:10:16.030
May I?

00:10:16.240 --> 00:10:18.360
I made a ton of oden!

00:10:18.360 --> 00:10:19.280
Oden!

00:10:19.280 --> 00:10:20.990
I'm saved...

00:10:21.400 --> 00:10:24.110
I thought I was happy just touching her hand.

00:10:22.360 --> 00:10:25.030
GLOOOOM

00:10:24.110 --> 00:10:26.860
But when she clings to me like that,
part of my brain flies away...

00:10:25.030 --> 00:10:28.700
GLOOOOM
I NEED A
COUNTER-STRATEGY

00:10:27.280 --> 00:10:28.780
What's wrong, Tsutsun?

00:10:29.110 --> 00:10:30.110
Nothing!

00:10:33.400 --> 00:10:35.070
Thank you for this meal!

00:10:37.360 --> 00:10:38.570
I love it!

00:10:38.570 --> 00:10:39.650
Oh, why thank you!

00:10:39.650 --> 00:10:41.360
Don't hold back. You eat as much as you want!

00:10:41.360 --> 00:10:41.860
Yes, ma'am!

00:10:42.110 --> 00:10:43.200
I'm glad you're here.

00:10:43.530 --> 00:10:47.280
After all you've done for me, I'd been hoping
for a chance to properly introduce myself.

00:10:47.490 --> 00:10:49.740
Oh, I didn't do anything special.

00:10:49.990 --> 00:10:53.280
Really, we're very sorry for all the fuss we made.

00:10:53.280 --> 00:10:55.450
N-no, please stop.

00:10:55.610 --> 00:10:59.700
Of course, if you wanted, I could have
taken you to Hokkaido with us!

00:10:59.700 --> 00:11:01.740
Oh, don't be silly.

00:11:01.860 --> 00:11:03.860
But the boys' father...

00:11:03.860 --> 00:11:07.200
He begged me not to break up with him!
So what's a woman to do?

00:11:08.400 --> 00:11:09.400
Iroha.

00:11:10.950 --> 00:11:13.360
I hope you'll keep taking good care of Hikari for me.

00:11:16.070 --> 00:11:17.070
I will.

00:11:17.860 --> 00:11:20.400
You grownups only think about yourselves.

00:11:20.400 --> 00:11:23.860
I've been so worried about all this,
I've barely slept in days.

00:11:24.400 --> 00:11:25.570
See?

00:11:25.570 --> 00:11:28.610
Kaoru still has unhealed emotional scars.

00:11:28.610 --> 00:11:29.610
You have to fix it!

00:11:29.860 --> 00:11:33.400
Don't think I don't know you tried
to sacrifice me to save yourself!

00:11:33.530 --> 00:11:34.860
Wh-what?!

00:11:36.150 --> 00:11:38.450
Would you like some more oden, Kaoru?

00:11:39.030 --> 00:11:40.900
I can't trust any of you anymore!

00:11:41.240 --> 00:11:43.610
Tell me! What did you ever see in him?

00:11:43.610 --> 00:11:44.900
What? Me?

00:11:44.900 --> 00:11:46.740
There's gotta be a million cooler guys out there, right?

00:11:46.900 --> 00:11:50.360
Kaoru! Don't say those things!
You'll bring Iroha back to her senses!

00:11:50.360 --> 00:11:51.450
H-hey!

00:11:51.700 --> 00:11:54.150
There is no one cooler than your brother.

00:11:54.150 --> 00:11:54.990
You're lying!

00:11:54.990 --> 00:11:56.360
No, I'm not.

00:11:56.780 --> 00:12:00.200
But I'm glad you didn't have to be separated.

00:12:02.070 --> 00:12:03.030
Yeah.

00:12:03.990 --> 00:12:07.200
Oh, you're acting like a real big sister, Iroha.

00:12:07.900 --> 00:12:09.490
It's nice to have a girl around.

00:12:09.490 --> 00:12:11.320
I-I wasn't trying to...

00:12:11.320 --> 00:12:13.820
Look, Kaoru is blushing! See?

00:12:13.820 --> 00:12:16.070
I-I'm not blushing.

00:12:13.820 --> 00:12:17.490
You know... she is like a part of the family!

00:12:17.860 --> 00:12:21.030
I wish a day like that could really come someday...

00:12:21.490 --> 00:12:24.400
Hey, everyone! It's time for dinner!

00:12:25.990 --> 00:12:26.990
No, stop!

00:12:26.990 --> 00:12:30.200
Stop fantasizing about things you don't deserve...
or you'll go to hell!

00:12:30.780 --> 00:12:33.610
Seriously? Is he really the one you want?

00:12:33.610 --> 00:12:35.110
Y-yeah...

00:12:37.530 --> 00:12:39.360
I'm stuffed.

00:12:39.360 --> 00:12:41.150
That was a lot of fun.

00:12:41.360 --> 00:12:45.240
I started to imagine that I really was a part of your family.

00:12:45.240 --> 00:12:46.360
It was so nice.

00:12:48.400 --> 00:12:51.900
Do you mind if I call you Big Sister?

00:12:53.570 --> 00:12:55.700
I-I wish you would.

00:12:54.400 --> 00:13:00.280
My brother
just calls me
Iroha.
No respect...

00:12:55.700 --> 00:13:00.200
Okay. If my brother marries you,
you really will be my sister anyway.

00:13:03.320 --> 00:13:04.990
A-are you stupid?!

00:13:04.990 --> 00:13:06.780
You can't just say stuff like that!

00:13:09.200 --> 00:13:11.860
That would be asking too much.

00:13:13.900 --> 00:13:15.200
Well...

00:13:15.200 --> 00:13:17.400
I'll be transferring schools in half a year.

00:13:20.820 --> 00:13:24.200
Oh! I had some shopping to do,
so you can drop me off here.

00:13:24.360 --> 00:13:25.700
Thanks for today.

00:13:25.700 --> 00:13:27.450
Thank you, too, Kaoru. See you later.

00:13:27.450 --> 00:13:28.820
Yeah, see you at school.

00:13:28.820 --> 00:13:29.740
Goodbye.

00:13:31.530 --> 00:13:34.490
Why did my new big sister
ever agree to be your girlfriend?

00:13:34.610 --> 00:13:36.030
I just don't get it.

00:13:36.030 --> 00:13:37.530
Good question.

00:13:38.530 --> 00:13:41.900
That reminds me. Did you go to the aquarium with Anzu?

00:13:42.360 --> 00:13:45.740
It wasn't exactly a good time for it,
with the Oshamambe scare going on.

00:13:45.740 --> 00:13:46.860
We'll go next week.

00:13:47.490 --> 00:13:50.110
Be careful when you go to Anzu's house.

00:13:50.360 --> 00:13:53.320
Her brother is a pretty big jerk.

00:13:59.150 --> 00:14:01.570
My first... boyfriend.

00:14:01.950 --> 00:14:05.400
And the next movie will be coming out next spring, so...

00:14:05.400 --> 00:14:06.650
Uh, Ayado?

00:14:07.990 --> 00:14:09.530
Ayado, are you listening?

00:14:09.530 --> 00:14:11.780
Huh? What? What were we talking about?

00:14:11.780 --> 00:14:14.110
Were you in your fantasy world again?

00:14:14.110 --> 00:14:16.280
Huh? Umm, well...

00:14:17.150 --> 00:14:20.570
Th-this person is my boyfriend... My boyfriend!

00:14:23.200 --> 00:14:24.530
It's so warm.

00:14:25.990 --> 00:14:27.490
I wonder why.

00:14:27.570 --> 00:14:30.990
The other day, I pushed him to the ground,
he put his arms around me.

00:14:31.150 --> 00:14:32.320
After all that, why?

00:14:32.950 --> 00:14:35.820
Ito-senpai told me he liked me.

00:14:36.150 --> 00:14:38.610
And even after that, he was always thinking of me.

00:14:39.070 --> 00:14:41.820
Wh-why didn't it affect me then?

00:14:42.030 --> 00:14:45.610
SHELL
Recovering from heartbreak

00:14:42.700 --> 00:14:45.740
Oh, of course. Because I was in my shell!

00:14:51.320 --> 00:14:53.530
Ayado is not quite herself.

00:14:54.400 --> 00:14:55.700
Oh, that's right.

00:14:55.780 --> 00:14:58.200
Ayado, are you free this Sunday?

00:14:58.200 --> 00:14:58.860
Huh?!

00:14:58.990 --> 00:15:01.150
There was that movie you wanted to see.

00:15:01.150 --> 00:15:02.900
It's out now, so do you want to go?

00:15:09.360 --> 00:15:11.240
Thanks for waiting, Ayado!

00:15:11.360 --> 00:15:13.150
I knew you'd get here early!

00:15:13.360 --> 00:15:15.610
I left early, too, but you still beat me.

00:15:19.110 --> 00:15:20.610
Come on, let's go.

00:15:31.700 --> 00:15:33.740
Wh-what do I do...?

00:15:33.860 --> 00:15:37.200
Ito-senpai and I are boyfriend and girlfriend now.

00:15:37.280 --> 00:15:39.570
Now we can go on dates where we hold hands like this.

00:15:39.570 --> 00:15:43.450
It's just one of the things I've seen in manga
and wished I could do in real life.

00:15:43.860 --> 00:15:47.780
Does this mean now I get
to experience it all with Ito-senpai?

00:15:47.990 --> 00:15:50.450
I-I can't stop fantasizing about it!

00:15:51.280 --> 00:15:52.650
Ayado?

00:16:01.030 --> 00:16:04.110
So... what did you like about the movie?

00:16:05.950 --> 00:16:06.780
Umm...

00:16:07.280 --> 00:16:08.400
I can't tell him!

00:16:08.400 --> 00:16:09.530
I can't tell him...

00:16:09.530 --> 00:16:13.950
that I spent our entire first date movie
fantasizing like a hormonal teenage boy!

00:16:13.950 --> 00:16:15.450
I could never tell him that!

00:16:16.570 --> 00:16:19.150
All because I've read so much manga on the subject...

00:16:19.450 --> 00:16:22.490
If he knew what was going on in my head,
he'd hate me forever!

00:16:22.610 --> 00:16:23.990
Um, Ayado?

00:16:23.990 --> 00:16:26.530
Uh, yes! I loved the whole thing!

00:16:29.490 --> 00:16:30.740
Really?

00:16:31.990 --> 00:16:34.530
Usually when we see a movie,
we have a lot to talk about.

00:16:34.530 --> 00:16:38.570
We go on and on about the story
and our favorite scenes...

00:16:45.650 --> 00:16:47.780
So what do you want to do now?

00:16:53.990 --> 00:16:57.110
O-oh no, I didn't mean to! I just wasn't expecting it, so I...!

00:16:57.110 --> 00:16:58.700
I-I-I'm sorry!

00:16:59.240 --> 00:17:01.150
I'm being too self-conscious!

00:17:01.150 --> 00:17:03.110
Aah, I'm so stupid!

00:17:07.650 --> 00:17:11.740
Ayado, is it possible that you're having
second thoughts about dating me?

00:17:11.950 --> 00:17:12.780
Huh?

00:17:13.200 --> 00:17:14.450
Why...?

00:17:14.740 --> 00:17:16.650
I can tell from looking at you.

00:17:16.650 --> 00:17:19.030
You've been pushing yourself all day.

00:17:20.150 --> 00:17:25.070
If you're thinking that you have to fall in love with me
now that we're dating, then don't worry.

00:17:25.070 --> 00:17:26.740
I'm not trying to force anything.

00:17:29.030 --> 00:17:32.860
All I want is to make you happy, Ayado.

00:17:33.320 --> 00:17:35.240
No, um...

00:17:35.860 --> 00:17:40.070
Here he was, thinking about me
with these pure, beautiful feelings.

00:17:40.240 --> 00:17:44.110
I could never tell him that
I've been thinking naughty thoughts all day!

00:17:47.280 --> 00:17:48.570
Ayado.

00:17:48.570 --> 00:17:52.070
You can think it over. Figure out what you really want
before we start doing this.

00:17:53.530 --> 00:17:54.780
That face...

00:17:55.740 --> 00:17:57.950
Goodbye, Ayado.

00:17:58.700 --> 00:18:02.650
I think he makes that face
when he's holding back his real feelings.

00:18:03.280 --> 00:18:06.570
What do I do? I had no idea
it was going to turn out this way.

00:18:07.400 --> 00:18:11.570
Now that I think of it,
I never actually told Senpai that I like him.

00:18:11.950 --> 00:18:13.400
I love you, Ayado.

00:18:14.030 --> 00:18:16.700
And he's told me so many times that he loves me!

00:18:17.240 --> 00:18:21.360
Before I liked you romantically, I liked you as a person.

00:18:26.700 --> 00:18:27.610
Senpai!

00:18:31.030 --> 00:18:32.280
It's not what you think!

00:18:32.820 --> 00:18:34.070
Ayado?

00:18:34.610 --> 00:18:35.950
I'm sorry!

00:18:35.950 --> 00:18:38.150
I love you, Senpai!

00:18:38.360 --> 00:18:41.320
I know you hid your pain all this time,
so you could be here to support me!

00:18:41.320 --> 00:18:42.950
And I love you!

00:18:43.860 --> 00:18:48.820
If it hadn't been for you, I could never
have become the person I am now!

00:18:49.400 --> 00:18:51.950
It's because you were always there for me...

00:18:52.320 --> 00:18:55.820
That I was able to stop looking at the ground all the time.

00:18:57.150 --> 00:18:59.650
I'm sorry for always causing you to make that face.

00:19:00.240 --> 00:19:03.820
Please stop holding back
your real feelings because of me!

00:19:08.610 --> 00:19:09.900
What a relief.

00:19:11.450 --> 00:19:14.860
Thank you, Ayado. I feel better now.

00:19:19.320 --> 00:19:22.320
But then... what were you so worried about?

00:19:23.240 --> 00:19:25.570
D-don't worry about me! I'm fine!

00:19:25.700 --> 00:19:29.570
You did just tell me not to hold back
my real feelings, didn't you?

00:19:31.360 --> 00:19:34.650
You shouldn't have to hold anything back, either, Ayado.

00:19:35.360 --> 00:19:36.780
Whatever it is, you can tell me.

00:19:37.450 --> 00:19:39.530
Are... are you sure?

00:19:39.530 --> 00:19:40.240
Yeah.

00:19:40.240 --> 00:19:43.030
You promise it won't make you hate me?

00:19:43.150 --> 00:19:44.530
I promise.

00:19:43.400 --> 00:19:45.200
I'm getting
scard now.
What is she
going to say...?

00:20:02.240 --> 00:20:03.280
I...

00:20:03.280 --> 00:20:06.400
I've been thinking about doing that sort of thing all day.

00:20:06.650 --> 00:20:07.900
I'm sorry.

00:20:10.860 --> 00:20:13.530
I-I'm sorry I didn't pick up on that.

00:20:14.030 --> 00:20:16.740
Is that okay? You'll still date me?

00:20:17.320 --> 00:20:19.070
J-just give me a second.

00:20:19.200 --> 00:20:21.360
It's all so sudden, I'm not sure what happened.

00:20:22.900 --> 00:20:24.860
Would you mind if I kissed you?

00:20:41.820 --> 00:20:45.860
I feel his breath. I feel the warmth of his body.

00:20:46.570 --> 00:20:48.280
This is something the old me...

00:20:48.570 --> 00:20:50.570
SHELL

00:20:48.990 --> 00:20:50.740
never could have felt.

00:20:52.950 --> 00:20:55.860
It's such a joyful sensation.

00:20:57.990 --> 00:20:59.200
Senpai...

00:20:59.820 --> 00:21:04.900
Would you mind... if I hit you with
the full force of my desires from now on?

00:21:05.450 --> 00:21:06.150
Huh?

00:21:07.700 --> 00:21:09.110
Slowly...

00:21:10.240 --> 00:21:12.070
We'll take it slow, okay?

00:21:15.320 --> 00:21:20.780
Kareha no rhythm owari no kisetsu

00:21:20.780 --> 00:21:24.860
Boku no te o hiiteta

00:21:26.030 --> 00:21:36.280
Shiroi toiki wa kiekaketeita mirai (mirai)

00:21:36.740 --> 00:21:54.320
Kurikaeshi demo furidashi demo ii mujaki ni misete

00:21:55.490 --> 00:22:00.740
Aitai hito ni aeta ka na

00:22:00.740 --> 00:22:05.990
Naritai hito ni nareta ka na

00:22:06.110 --> 00:22:16.650
Kimi ga kimi rashiku iru koto de boku ga boku rashiku ireta yo

00:22:16.780 --> 00:22:22.030
Tada iki o suru kyou to iu hi ga

00:22:22.030 --> 00:22:27.280
Nani yori subarashii koto sa

00:22:27.360 --> 00:22:32.610
Nanimo iranai saa ikou

00:22:32.740 --> 00:22:40.740
Shinpai nanka nanimo nai
